Z||000011||My7Fieros||10-15-2000||02:11 AM||||Thanx for the kind words Dave...if you recall, Ive talked to you in the past regarding this car, pretty much when I first got it. I told you it was gonna be a job!<BR>I honestly couldnt begin to tell you how many hours I put into that thing...lets just stick with ALOT! lol....Yes, it was worth it, but Im not going to do that again until I get a house w/a garage. So much of this work was done in the very parking lot where you see it...until I finally took it to a friends house in his garage (my roommates brother)...I really appreciate him letting me clutter up his garage w/ the car for several months.<BR>I have really fallen in love w/ the Formula body style..I think my next one will be another Formula...it'll be painted silver more than likely.||||reg||1
